Root 1 (matrix_stamp_compare): the module carried DEFAULT_EVIDENCE =
  qa/reconcile-all.log, a file this tree does not hold, so the authority run
  read E_MSC_REGEN forever while the doc-recorded run read PASS. AC-MSC4's
  agreement leg therefore could never be green. Repair: the default evidence is
  DERIVED from the face the doc states it was rendered from; a doc stating none
  refuses E_MSC_NO_EVIDENCE at rc=4 with zero regenerator calls and zero writes.
  Second defect found while measuring: a --stamp-from render prints one
  provenance row that a plain --write doc never carries, so the byte compare was
  comparing two different document shapes (58 bytes apart). That row is now
  stripped from BOTH sides, because it exists only because this comparison
  asked for it.
Root 2 (test_stamp_text_coverage): with no borrow line recorded, source is None
  and the criterion compared str(None) - the word "None" - against the module
  source, reddening on the docstring stamp_from=None. Repair: the borrow guard
  applies only to a real path, and the borrow legs build their probe document
  through the shipped renderer instead of assuming the doc carries one.
